"{\"activities\":[{\"name\":\"Identify Risks\",\"description\":\"The 'Identify Risks' activity represents the process of identifying potential risks that could impact business continuity.\"},{\"name\":\"Develop Continuity Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Develop Continuity Plan' activity involves creating a comprehensive continuity plan to address identified risks and ensure operational resilience.\"},{\"name\":\"Test Continuity Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Test Continuity Plan' activity entails executing tests on the developed continuity plan to evaluate its effectiveness and readiness.\"},{\"name\":\"Review Test Results\",\"description\":\"The 'Review Test Results' activity involves analyzing the outcomes of continuity plan tests to assess performance and identify areas for improvement.\"},{\"name\":\"Implement Improvements\",\"description\":\"The 'Implement Improvements' activity consists of applying corrective actions and enhancements to the continuity plan based on test result reviews.\"},{\"name\":\"Communicate Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Communicate Plan' activity involves disseminating the continuity plan to relevant stakeholders through appropriate communication channels.\"},{\"name\":\"Monitor Risks\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Risks' activity entails continuously tracking and observing identified risks to detect changes in their severity or likelihood.\"},{\"name\":\"Conduct Training\",\"description\":\"The 'Conduct Training' activity involves providing training sessions to personnel on the continuity plan procedures and their roles during an incident.\"},{\"name\":\"Activate Continuity Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Activate Continuity Plan' activity represents the execution of the continuity plan in response to an actual incident or disruption.\"},{\"name\":\"Evaluate Incident Response\",\"description\":\"The 'Evaluate Incident Response' activity involves assessing the effectiveness of the activated continuity plan and the overall response to the inc