e activation of the continuity plan.\",\"min_value\":null,\"max_value\":null,\"enumeration_values\":[\"Low\",\"Medium\",\"High\"]}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Activate Continuity Plan: Incident Severity' links the 'Activate Continuity Plan' activity with the attribute 'Incident Severity', specifying that the severity of the triggering incident must be recorded upon activation.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Evaluate Incident Response\",\"description\":\"The 'Evaluate Incident Response' activity involves assessing the effectiveness of the activated continuity plan and the overall response to the incident.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"float\",\"name\":\"Response Time\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Response Time: float between 0.0 and 24.0' represents the time taken to respond to an incident, measured in hours up to 24.\",\"min_value\":0.0,\"max_value\":24.0,\"enumeration_values\":null}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Evaluate Incident Response: Response Time' links the 'Evaluate Incident Response' activity with the attribute 'Response Time', specifying that the response time to the incident must be assessed and recorded.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Monitor Risks\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Risks' activity entails continuously tracking and observing identified risks to detect changes in their severity or likelihood.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"integer\",\"name\":\"Monitoring Frequency\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Monitoring Frequency: integer between 1 and 30' represents how often risks are monitored, expressed as the number of times per period within a range of 1 to 30.\",\"min_value\":1,\"max_value\":30,\"enumeration_values\":null}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Monitor Risks: Monitoring Frequency' links the 'Monitor Risks' activity with the attribute 'Monitoring Frequency', specifying that the frequency of risk monitoring must be tracked.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Develop Continuity Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Develop Continuity Plan' activity involves creating a comprehensive continuity plan to address identified risks and ensure operational resilience.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"enumeration\",\"name\":\"Stakeholder Engagement\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Stakeholder Engagement: High, Moderate, Low' indicates the level of engagement of stakeholders during the development of the continuity plan.\",\"min_value\":null,\"max_value\":null,\"enumeration_values\":[\"High\",\"Moderate\",\"Low\"]}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Develop Continuity Plan: Stakeholder Engagement' links the 'Develop Continuity Plan' activity with the attribute 'Stakeholder Engagement', specifying that the level of stakeholder engagement during plan development must be recorded.\"}],\"constraints\":[{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Identify Risks' activity must be the first activity to occur in the process.\",\"template\":\"Init\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Identify Risks\",\"description\":\"The 'Identify Risks' activity represents the process of identifying potential risks that could impact business continuity.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Evaluate Incident Response' activity must be the last activity to occur in the process.\",\"template\":\"End\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Evaluate Incident Response\",\"description\":\"The 'Evaluate Incident Response' activity involves assessing the effectiveness of the activated continuity plan and the overall response to the incident.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Test Continuity Plan' activity occurs with the activation condition that the test outcome is 'Pass', then a 'Review Test Results' activity must occur after that 'Test Continuity Plan' event and before any subsequent 'Test Continuity Plan' occurs, with no other occurrence of 'Test Continuity Plan' allowed between a 'Test Continuity Plan' and its corresponding 'Review Test Results'. Additionally, the time condition requires that the 'Review Test Results' activity must be triggered between 0 and 2 days after the 'Test Continuity Plan' event.\",\"template\":\"Alternate Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Test Continuity Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Test Continuity Plan' activity entails executing tests on the developed continuity plan to evaluate its effectiveness and readiness.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Review Test Results\",\"description\":\"The 'Review Test Results' activity involves analyzing the outcomes of continuity plan tests to assess performance and identify areas for improvement.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Test Outcome is Pass\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,2,d\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"Whenever a 'Review Test Results' activity occurs with the activation condition that the plan effectiveness is less than 80.0, it must be immediately followed by an 'Implement Improvements' activity in the next event position, with no other events in between. The correlation condition requires that the improvement status of the 'Implement Improvements' event is 'Pending'. Additionally, the time condition requires that the 'Implement Improvements' activity must be triggered within at most 48 hours after the 'Review Test Results' event.\",\"template\":\"Chain Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Review Test Results\",\"description\":\"The 'Review Test Results' activity involves analyzing the outcomes of continuity plan tests to assess performance and identify areas for improvement.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Implement Improvements\",\"description\":\"The 'Implement Improvements' activity consists of applying corrective actions and enhancements to the continuity plan based on test result reviews.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Plan Effectiveness < 80.0\",\"correlation_condition\":\"A.Improvement Status is Pending\",\"time_condition\":\"0,48,h\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Develop Continuity Plan' activity occurs with the activation condition that the stakeholder engagement is 'High', then a 'Communicate Plan' activity must eventually occur after the 'Develop Continuity Plan' event at some point in the same process instance. The correlation condition requires that the communication method of the 'Communicate Plan' event is in the set (Email, Meeting). Additionally, the time condition requires that the 'Communicate Plan' activity must be triggered between 5 and 13 minutes after the 'Develop Continuity Plan' event.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Develop Continuity Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Develop Continuity Plan' activity involves creating a comprehensive continuity plan to address identified risks and ensure operational resilience.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Communicate Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Communicate Plan' activity involves disseminating the continuity plan to relevant stakeholders through appropriate communication channels.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Stakeholder Engagement is High\",\"correlation_condition\":\"A.Communication Method in (Email, Meeting)\",\"time_condition\":\"5,13,m\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Communicate Plan' activity occurs in a process instance with the activation condition that the communication method is 'Meeting', then a 'Conduct Training' activity must also occur at least once within the same process instance, either before or after the 'Communicate Plan' event. If 'Communicate Plan' does not occur, there is no requirement for 'Conduct Training' to occur.\",\"template\":\"Responded Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Communicate Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Communicate Plan' activity involves disseminating the continuity plan to relevant stakeholders through appropriate communication channels.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Conduct Training\",\"description\":\"The 'Conduct Training' activity involves providing training sessions to personnel on the continuity plan procedures and their roles during an incident.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Communication Method is Meeting\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Identify Risks' activity is permitted to occur only if an 'Activate Continuity Plan' activity has occurred before it within the same process instance, with the activation condition that the incident severity is in the set (Medium, High). 'Identify Risks' events that occur without any prior 'Activate Continuity Plan' are violations of the constraint.\",\"template\":\"Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Activate Continuity Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Activate Continuity Plan' activity represents the execution of the continuity plan in response to an actual incident or disruption.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Identify Risks\",\"description\":\"The 'Identify Risks' activity represents the process of identifying potential risks that could impact business continuity.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Incident Severity in (Medium, High)\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Monitor Risks' activity occurs with the activation condition that the monitoring frequency is less than or equal to 7, then an 'Identify Risks' activity must also occur in the same process instance, and vice versa. This mutual obligation ensures that neither event can occur without the other.\",\"template\":\"Co-Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Monitor Risks\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Risks' activity entails continuously tracking and observing identified risks to detect changes in their severity or likelihood.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Identify Risks\",\"description\":\"The 'Identify Risks' activity represents the process of identifying potential risks that could impact business continuity.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Monitoring Frequency <= 7\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"An 'Activate Continuity Plan' activity with the activation condition that the incident severity is 'High' cannot be immediately followed by an 'Evaluate Incident Response' activity; there must be at least one other event between them. Additionally, the time condition requires that the constraint is evaluated within a window of 10 to 15 seconds.\",\"template\":\"Not Chain Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Activate Continuity Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Activate Continuity Plan' activity represents the execution of the continuity plan in response to an actual incident or disruption.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Evaluate Incident Response\",\"description\":\"The 'Evaluate Incident Response' activity involves assessing the effectiveness of the activated continuity plan and the overall response to the incident.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Incident Severity is High\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"10,15,s\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Conduct Training' activity must occur at least once in the process, with the activation condition that the training hours are greater than or equal to 8.\",\"template\":\"Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Conduct Training\",\"description\":\"The 'Conduct Training' activity involves providing training sessions to personnel on the continuity plan procedures and their roles during an incident.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":\"A.Training Hours >= 8\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null}]}"